  "description": "Bae Songwoo is in a one-sided love with his longtime friend, Kim Sangjin. Living his life hiding his feelings, one day Bae Songwoo finds a suspicious book in his house, and written inside is Kim Sangjin's life story.\nBut Bae Songwoo is just a passing extra...?!\nAs he tries to ignore the book, Bae Songwoo soon realises that everything is going as written...",
